---
// Meituan Leaf Double Buffer Segment Architecture Diagram Component
---

<figure class="leaf-diagram" aria-labelledby="leaf-diagram-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG layout (ViewBox 840x440, clear 3-block pipeline, large legible fonts, generous padding) -->
  <svg
    class="leaf-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 840 440"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="leaf-diagram-title leaf-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="leaf-diagram-title">
      美團 Leaf 雙 Buffer 非同步號段平滑切換架構圖
    </title>
    <desc id="leaf-diagram-desc">
      展示應用服務當前消耗 Buffer 1，餘量達到 10% 閾值時觸發非同步執行緒向 MySQL
      批量獲取新號段寫入 Buffer 2；Buffer 1 耗盡瞬間，指標極速切換至 Buffer
      2，實現 100% 零阻塞發號與 DB 容災。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="leaf-arrow-purple"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="leaf-diagram__arrow-head--purple"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="leaf-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="leaf-diagram__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="leaf-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="leaf-diagram__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Card 1: Buffer 1 (Active) (X: 20, Y: 25, W: 380, H: 200) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 25)">
      <rect
        width="380"
        height="200"
        rx="12"
        class="leaf-diagram__card leaf-diagram__card--green"></rect>
      <text class="leaf-diagram__badge leaf-diagram__badge--green" x="20" y="30"
        >BUFFER 1 (ACTIVE IN USE)</text
      >
      <text class="leaf-diagram__title leaf-diagram__title--green" x="20" y="58"
        >記憶體號段 1：高頻讀取中</text
      >

      <!-- Subbox for Segment range & atomic operation -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="344"
          height="60"
          rx="8"
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox leaf-diagram__subbox--green"></rect>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox-title leaf-diagram__subbox-title--green"
          x="172"
          y="25"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          號段區間：ID 1001 ~ 2000 (步長 1000)
        </text>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox-code leaf-diagram__subbox-code--green"
          x="172"
          y="46"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          AtomicLong.incrementAndGet() ➔ O(1) 極速發號
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Trigger callout -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 152)">
        <text class="leaf-diagram__desc" x="0" y="16"
          >• 剩餘 10% 閾值 (餘量 ≤ 100 筆) ➔ 觸發非同步預載</text
        >
        <text class="leaf-diagram__desc" x="0" y="36"
          >• 線上業務完全不阻塞，繼續極速取號</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 1: Buffer 1 -> DB Async Fetch (Rightward) -->
    <path
      d="M 400 115 L 435 115"
      class="leaf-diagram__flow-line leaf-diagram__flow-line--purple"
      marker-end="url(#leaf-arrow-purple)"></path>

    <!-- Card 2: Async Thread & DB (X: 445, Y: 25, W: 375, H: 200) -->
    <g transform="translate(445, 25)">
      <rect
        width="375"
        height="200"
        rx="12"
        class="leaf-diagram__card leaf-diagram__card--purple"></rect>
      <text
        class="leaf-diagram__badge leaf-diagram__badge--purple"
        x="20"
        y="30">ASYNC THREAD & DB</text
      >
      <text
        class="leaf-diagram__title leaf-diagram__title--purple"
        x="20"
        y="58">非同步背景執行緒 ➔ DB 交互</text
      >

      <!-- Subbox for DB SQL -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="339"
          height="60"
          rx="8"
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox leaf-diagram__subbox--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox-code leaf-diagram__subbox-code--purple"
          x="170"
          y="25"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          UPDATE tbl SET max_id = max_id + 1000
        </text>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox-title leaf-diagram__subbox-title--purple"
          x="170"
          y="46"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          單次 SQL I/O 預載下一區間 2001 ~ 3000
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Features -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 152)">
        <text class="leaf-diagram__desc" x="0" y="16"
          >• 預先申請號段並寫入 Buffer 2</text
        >
        <text class="leaf-diagram__desc" x="0" y="36"
          >• DB 容災：資料庫若短暫當機，系統仍可發號數分鐘</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 2: DB -> Buffer 2 (Downward) -->
    <path
      d="M 632 225 L 632 265"
      class="leaf-diagram__flow-line leaf-diagram__flow-line--blue"
      marker-end="url(#leaf-arrow-blue)"></path>

    <!-- Card 3: Buffer 2 (Standby / Handover) (X: 20, Y: 275, W: 800, H: 135) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 275)">
      <rect
        width="800"
        height="135"
        rx="12"
        class="leaf-diagram__card leaf-diagram__card--blue"></rect>
      <text class="leaf-diagram__badge leaf-diagram__badge--blue" x="20" y="28"
        >BUFFER 2 (HOT STANDBY ➔ SEAMLESS HANDOVER)</text
      >
      <text class="leaf-diagram__title leaf-diagram__title--blue" x="20" y="54"
        >記憶體號段 2：熱待命中 ➔ Buffer 1 耗盡瞬間無縫切換！</text
      >

      <!-- Inner Horizontal Flow -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 70)">
        <rect
          width="360"
          height="46"
          rx="8"
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox leaf-diagram__subbox--blue"></rect>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox-title leaf-diagram__subbox-title--blue"
          x="180"
          y="28"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          號段 2 預載完畢：ID 2001 ~ 3000 就緒
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 3: Handover inside Card 3 -->
      <path
        d="M 390 93 L 420 93"
        class="leaf-diagram__flow-line leaf-diagram__flow-line--green"
        marker-end="url(#leaf-arrow-green)"></path>

      <g transform="translate(430, 70)">
        <rect
          width="352"
          height="46"
          rx="8"
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox leaf-diagram__subbox--green"></rect>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__highlight"
          x="176"
          y="28"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          ✔ 雙指標極速原子切換 ➔ 達成 100% 零阻塞無感發號！
        </text>
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile vertical layout (<= 48rem / 768px) -->
  <div class="leaf-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="leaf-mobile-card leaf-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="leaf-mobile-badge leaf-mobile-badge--green"
        >BUFFER 1 (ACTIVE)</span
      >
      <h4>記憶體號段 1：高頻讀取消耗中</h4>
      <p>
        應用層透過 AtomicLong 純記憶體操作發號，吞吐量突破百萬級；當號段消耗達
        90%（剩餘 10%）時，非同步喚醒背景執行緒。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-arrow">↓ 餘量 ≤ 10% 非同步喚醒預載</div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-card leaf-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="leaf-mobile-badge leaf-mobile-badge--purple"
        >ASYNC DB FETCH</span
      >
      <h4>非同步執行緒批次獲取新號段</h4>
      <p>
        背景執行緒單次 SQL I/O 向資料庫預先申請下一個號段（如
        2001~3000），並預載至備用 Buffer 2，完全不阻塞線上請求。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-arrow">↓ Buffer 1 耗盡瞬間指標原子切換</div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-card leaf-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="leaf-mobile-badge leaf-mobile-badge--blue"
        >BUFFER 2 (HOT STANDBY)</span
      >
      <h4>Buffer 2 無縫接管發號</h4>
      <p>
        雙 Buffer 指標毫秒級原子切換，達成 100%
        零延遲抖動；即便底層資料庫短暫當機 10~30 分鐘，發號服務依然平穩運作。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="leaf-diagram-caption">
    圖：美團 Leaf 雙 Buffer 號段架構 —— 10%
    閾值非同步預載、零阻塞發號與資料庫容災
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .leaf-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Base Tokens */
  .leaf-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__card--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__card--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__card--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__card--purple {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__card--blue {
    stroke: #2563eb;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__card--blue {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__badge--purple {
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__badge--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__badge--blue {
    fill: #2563eb;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__badge--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__title--purple {
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__title--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__title--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__title--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.06);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.14);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox--purple {
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06);
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox--purple {
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.14);
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox--blue {
    fill: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.06);
    stroke: #2563eb;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox--blue {
    fill: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.14);
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox-title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox-title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox-title--purple {
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox-title--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox-title--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox-title--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox-code {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox-code--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox-code--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox-code--purple {
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox-code--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .leaf-diagram__highlight {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__highlight {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__flow-line {
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    fill: none;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__flow-line--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__flow-line--purple {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__flow-line--blue {
    stroke: #2563eb;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__flow-line--blue {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__flow-line--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__flow-line--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #a78bfa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #2563eb;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Mobile Breakpoint (≤ 48rem / 768px) */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .leaf-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .leaf-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-card--purple {
      border-color: #a78bfa;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #60a5fa;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      font-family:
        system-ui,
        -apple-system,
        sans-serif;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family:
        system-ui,
        -apple-system,
        sans-serif;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #2563eb;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  }
</style>
